   {t:'The x-vector: hedge_ratio regresses one stock on another; CAPM regresses the strategy on the market index.',c:true,
    w:'Correct. Both run OLS slope: β = cov(y,x)/var(x). The math is identical; the domain is different. hedge_ratio uses asset B as x; CAPM uses SPY/market returns as x.'},
