    w:'Wrong — unconstrained CAPM estimated via OLS includes a free intercept (Jensen\'s alpha). Setting α=0 is the CAPM null hypothesis, not the estimation procedure.'},
   {t:'hedge_ratio uses log returns while CAPM uses simple returns, requiring different numerical procedures.',c:false,
    w:'Wrong — pairs.py uses whatever array you pass in; CAPM implementations typically use simple daily returns too. The choice of return type is independent of the OLS algorithm.'},
